<p>Also thank you to all of the others who tried out for these roles, your enthusiasm and willingness to help was incredibly motivating.</p>
<p>Now I gotta give a shout out to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/shaggydredlocks" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1722371); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1722371&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1523648543" alt="Shaggydredlocks" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1722371)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/shaggydredlocks" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1722371); return false;">Shaggydredlocks</a></span> who helped me throughout almost every stage of the process, from the structuring of the article to final touch-ups on the video.</p>
